WEBVTT

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:15.730
What do you think you're doing?!

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:16.940
Give me that!

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:21.070
Hey, what gives? That's my fried prawn!

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:24.160
Don't just take the last 
fried prawn like it's yours!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.460
Don't you know the meaning of "equal shares"?

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.000
It's first come, first served!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.090
Too slow!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.420
You don't want it, Azusa?

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.470
You didn't eat much.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.310
I'll take it... if you're giving it to me...

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.640
That's not what I asked.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.310
Just tell me if you want it or not.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.110
Okay... I want it.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.020
Here.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.620
What do I keep telling you?

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.780
No ruckus at the dinner table.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.070
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:06.450
Hey, there's more! You should've said so!

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:10.160
Don't take it before the rest of us get any!

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:15.170
Azusa, don't just sit there. 
Eat before Kou takes it all.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.840
You eat, too.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.510
Okay.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.930
You made all this?

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.560
What if I did?

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:33.600
Uh, nothing, it's just... 
I'm amazed you can cook.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:34.940
And...

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.980
Hey, I got less!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.320
You just ate a whole bunch of them!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.950
You're all very close.
It's kind of refreshing.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.410
Hurry up and eat. We don't have time.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.460
Time?

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.710
That's right. We have to go to school.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.540
Oh, me too...

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.960
Idiot.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:02.170
You're staying here, sow.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:05.590
The Sakamaki brothers will be at school, too.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.720
But...

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:12.560
The one in charge of keeping an eye on 
the masochistic kitten today is Azusa-kun.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.750
Just Eve and me...

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.990
I'm so happy.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.240
We're counting on you, Azusa.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:28.780
Yeah.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:33.250
See you, sow. Behave yourself.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.370
Now, masochistic kitten,

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.460
Azusa-kun can be a bit of 
a handful, so be careful.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.190
Eve.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.360
Come to... my room.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.240
Why?

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.490
I want to... show you something.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.510
Come in.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:36.020
A-Azusa-kun... 
What did you want to show me?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:43.610
These. All... my treasures.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:49.870
Hey, can I... ask a question?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:56.040
Do you... love me?

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:03.800
Will you... hit me?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.590
O-Of course not! I can't do that!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.150
Oh... Too bad.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:15.060
You hate me...

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.600
Wh-Why would you say that?

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:24.780
But I... don't hate... you.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:33.330
Your scent... is just like... mine.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:39.490
Hey... See this knife?

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:42.790
I just sharpened it.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:50.680
I want to see it... pierce your skin.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:55.010
I bet... it's beautiful.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.690
No! Stop it, Azusa-kun!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:09.070
You resist... that much?

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:16.870
Then... cut me... instead.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.950
I can't...

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.620
It's fine.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.290
N-No!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.720
You worthless stray!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:40.100
<i>When I bleed, everyone is happy.</i>

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:41.520
S-Sorr—

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.610
Don't talk to me with that annoying tone!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.610
Justin, he's laughing...

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.000
Hey, what's so funny?!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:07.380
Will you... please... hit me more?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.510
What a freak!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.130
Melissa, Christina, let's get outta here.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.390
Wait... Please, wait...

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.220
Why are you leaving?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.430
More...

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.390
Hurt me more.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:24.810
<i>Hit me more.</i>

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:30.780
<i>Please, give me a reason to live...
Proof that I'm alive...</i>

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:34.910
Yes... That's good.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.160
That's very good.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.030
I-It's not good!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.410
We have to treat it...

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.250
Azusa-kun?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.080
No need.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:51.920
Just... give me your blood.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.300
It's all right, isn't it?

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:56.640
No—

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:12.320
It's so velvety... and sweet...

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.910
This is Eve's blood...

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:27.960
You're so fortunate... to have such blood...

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.000
I told you, I'm not Eve!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:35.970
I'll suck more out of you. Are you happy?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:39.970
I-It hurts, Azusa-kun!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.640
Hurts? Yes...

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:49.980
The greater the pain, the better... Right?

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:56.860
I'll make you feel more...

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:03.290
Because you are my precious... Eve.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.750
That's enough.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:13.960
Yuma... Welcome home.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.540
Eve.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:55.960
You really are... the same as me.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.470
Justin...

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.700
Hey, Justin.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:06.520
Do you think... I can become Adam?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.560
Can I be...

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:18.650
of use to him?

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.720
Hit me more... Give me more pain...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:31.560
When I'm in pain, everyone is happy.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:35.520
That's the proof that I am alive.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:40.440
Do you... love me?
